        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Leaving Lyndow is a short, first-person exploration adventure game, set in the Eastshade universe. It's Clara's last day on the island where she grew up. With high honors, she's graduated and fulfilled her childhood dream of joining the Guild of Maritime Exploration. She needs to complete preparations, visit her favorite places, and say her goodbyes before leaving on a journey she may not return from. *dangerous journey not included*",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Leaving Lyndow es una aventura de exploración corta, en primera persona, ambientada en el universo de Eastshade. Es el último día de Clara en la isla donde creció. Con grandes honores, se ha graduado y ha cumplido su sueño de infancia de unirse al Gremio de Exploración Marítima. Debe completar los preparativos, visitar sus lugares favoritos y despedirse antes de emprender un viaje del que quizá no regrese. *viaje peligroso no incluido*",
          "source": "claude",
